{
  "id": "p28",
  "title": "The Dispute at the Lake",
  "titleZh": "湖边的争执",
  "topic": "湖泊渔业争端",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Later we gather evidence beside the wide, quiet lake.",
        "zh": "后来我们在宽阔安静的湖边收集证据。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A new tax will finance the slow clean-up of the water.",
        "zh": "一项新税将为缓慢的水体清理提供资金。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt's club will represent the majority of local families.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的俱乐部将代表当地大多数家庭。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Age and sex do not change the slow track of the disease.",
        "zh": "年龄和性别并不改变这种疾病缓慢的传播轨迹。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small grant plus a private gift is a useful addition.",
        "zh": "一小笔补助加上一份私人捐赠是一项有用的补充。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old rules are exactly the same under the current regulation.",
        "zh": "在现行法规下，旧规则完全一样。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then their plan will consist of three steps and a public opening.",
        "zh": "然后他们的计划将包括三个步骤和一次公开开幕。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One large expense may force the group to abandon the plan.",
        "zh": "一笔大开销可能迫使这个团体放弃计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A slight change makes an absolute difference to the fish.",
        "zh": "一个微小的变化对鱼来说却是绝对的不同。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the heavy nets drag along the lake bottom without ease.",
        "zh": "然后沉重的渔网毫不轻松地拖过湖底。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We must get rid of the waste before the colours fade.",
        "zh": "我们必须在颜色褪去之前清除这些废物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin, an elegant actress, supports the lake campaign.",
        "zh": "我的表亲是一位优雅的演员，她支持保护湖泊的运动。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Each small wave will lap against the hunter's wooden boat.",
        "zh": "每一个小浪都会拍打猎人那条木船。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The two sides accord on one point: they must maintain the lake.",
        "zh": "双方在一个问题上达成一致：他们必须维护这个湖。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My father says a cheap filter is a good option for consumers.",
        "zh": "我父亲说，便宜的过滤器对消费者来说是个不错的选择。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Leaders occupy the summit hall for the whole long afternoon.",
        "zh": "领导们整个漫长的下午都待在峰会大厅里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In strong contrast, the east lane stays clean and clear.",
        "zh": "与之形成强烈对比的是，东边的小路依然干净清亮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A fair comparison may alter the final and difficult decision.",
        "zh": "公正的比较可能会改变最终而艰难的决定。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then one opponent lacks imagination and repeats old claims.",
        "zh": "然后一位反对者缺乏想象力，重复着旧的说法。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Critics criticize the plan, and their sharp words echo for weeks.",
        "zh": "批评者批评这个计划，他们尖锐的话回荡了好几周。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A health alert warns every sector of the lake trade.",
        "zh": "一项健康警报提醒着湖泊贸易的每个部门。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The federation may add a penalty for each broken rule.",
        "zh": "联合会可能会对每一条被破坏的规则加收罚款。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Its rating falls, and wise counsel arrives a little too late.",
        "zh": "它的评分下降，明智的建议来得有点太晚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One worried investor leaves the fishing business before winter.",
        "zh": "一位忧心的投资者在冬天前离开了渔业生意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Some older members remain opposed to the new responsibility.",
        "zh": "一些年长的成员仍然反对这项新责任。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A severe winter storm mixes the shallows with the deep water.",
        "zh": "一场严酷的冬季风暴把浅水与深水混在一起。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A clinic treats anxious children and one difficult childhood case.",
        "zh": "一家诊所治疗焦虑的儿童和一个艰难的童年病例。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A molecule study meets old philosophy and intellectual pride.",
        "zh": "一项分子研究与古老的哲学和知识分子的骄傲相遇。"
      }
    ]
  ],
